#: PackageDetailDockWidget.cpp:376
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Shaman is currently querying %1, the package management system, to cache the "
"necessary information needed for it to work.\n"
"This should take just a few seconds, you can see more details about what is "
"happening in the status bar."
msgstr ""
"Shaman trenutno ispituje %1, sistem za upravljanje paketima, kako bi "
"pohranio u cache potrebne informacije potrebne za rad.\n"
"To bi trebalo trajati samo nekoliko sekundi, možete vidjeti više detalja o "
"tome šta se događa u statusnoj traci."

#: PackageDetailDockWidget.cpp:384
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Shaman is waiting for an exclusive lock on the package management system"
msgstr "Shaman čeka ekskluzivno priključivanje na sistem upravljanja paketa"

#: PackageDetailDockWidget.cpp:385
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To operate correctly, Shaman must be the only application acting on %1, the "
"package management system.\n"
"Shaman detected that another running application, such as another frontend "
"or a terminal program, is holding a lock on it. Please close it to resume "
"normal operation"
msgstr ""
"Za pravilan rad, Shaman mora biti jedina aplikacija koja djeluje na %1, "
"sistem za upravljanje paketa.\n"
"Shaman je otkrio da postoje druge pokrenute aplikacije, kao što su još jedan "
"frontend ili terminal programa, koji ga koči. Molimo vas da ga zatvorite "
"kako bi nastavio normalan rad"

#: PackageDetailDockWidget.cpp:393
#, kde-format
msgid "Choose a package to view detailed information about it here"
msgstr "Odaberite paket za prikaz detaljnih informacija o tome ovdje"

#: PackageDetailDockWidget.cpp:394
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Shaman is able to provide extended information about a package, such as "
"packages requiring it, its dependencies, a list of the files contained in "
"it, and more. Just click on a package to make its details be shown here"
msgstr ""
"Shaman je u mogućnosti pružiti dodatne informacije o paketu, kao što to "
"zahtijevi paketa, njihove zavisnosti, popis datoteka sadržanih u njima, i "
"još mnogo toga. Samo kliknite na paket da bi njegovi detalji biti prikazan "
"ovdje"

